        {
          "type": "prose",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every piece is handcrafted by master artisans who bring decades of skill to each cut, setting, and polish. Designs are guided by heritage and made for real lives — jewelry that becomes a treasured heirloom.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
